==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|в-|пасть}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-впасть.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|впасть|pf|impf=впада́ть}}

# ''(river)'' to [[fall]] ''(into)'', to [[flow]] ''(into)''
# ''(a condition)'' to [[fall]] ''(into)'', to [[lapse]] ''(into)'', to [[sink]] ''(into)''
#: {{uxi|ru|'''впасть''' [[в]] [[заду́мчивость]]|to fall into a reverie}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''впасть''' [[в]] [[отча́яние]]|to give way to despair; be driven into despair}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''впасть''' [[в]] [[сомне́ние]]|to begin to have doubts}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''впасть''' [[в]] [[неми́лость]]|to fall into disfavour/disfavor/disgrace}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''впасть''' [[в]] [[де́тство]]|to enter one's second childhood; be in one's dotage}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''впасть''' [[в]] [[противоре́чие]]|contradict oneself}}
# ''(cheeks, eyes etc.)'' to [[sink in]], to [[become]] [[hollow]]/[[sunken]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf-intr|7b|впасть|впад}}

